<title>UK: Results still awaited in Iran's raw sugar tender.</title>
<headline>Results still awaited in Iran's raw sugar tender.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results are still awaited in Iran's tender to buy 30,000 tonnes of raw sugar, European traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Iran tendered earlier this week to buy raw sugar for June/July shipment, they said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
</text>
